WEBVTT

00:05:29.227 --> 00:05:31.379
Bu urg’u, ohang va
intonatsiyaning birikmasi,

00:05:31.403 --> 00:05:33.453
ular bilan, biz gapning
mazmunini uzatamiz.

00:05:33.477 --> 00:05:36.291
Bu suhbatga ma’no beruvchi
birinchi narsadir.

00:05:36.315 --> 00:05:40.371
Bitta notada gapiruvchi
insonlarni tinglash juda qiyin,

00:05:40.395 --> 00:05:42.587
chunki ularda prosodiya elementi yo’q.

00:05:42.611 --> 00:05:45.562
Shu sababga ko’ra “zerikarli”
va “monotonniy”

00:05:45.586 --> 00:05:47.523
so’zlari paydo bo’lgan.

00:05:48.306 --> 00:05:51.579
Hozirda qaytarilish prosodiyasi
mashhur bo’lib qolgan,

00:05:51.603 --> 00:05:54.299
unda barcha gaplar
tasdiq shaklida kelsa ham,

00:05:54.323 --> 00:05:56.800
savol ohangi bilan yakunlanadi.

00:05:56.824 --> 00:05:59.130
(Kulgi)

00:05:59.154 --> 00:06:00.716
Va buni cheksiz qaytaraversak,